s (+15%). A category bonus applies to every pick in it, so Science is stored with no bonus and the +15% on Mathematics: Advanced is NOT stored; it is stated in the related-skills note and GM Notes. Secondary skills: two at levels 2, 5, 10 and 15 and none at level one, stored as count 0 with a schedule. || MONEY: 2D4x$100 in dollars or Universal Credits is starting_money; the 1D4x$1000 in tradeable goods (the text layer prints lD4x$1000) is in GM Notes with NPC villains (typically anarchist or evil) will have 3-5 times more. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: the night suit (black jump suit, gloves, rubber-soled boots, balaclava, climbing harness), the city clothes, various harnesses and belts, a wristwatch, a glass cutter, the M.D. energy pistol (player choice; its four E-Clips are stored), everything kept back at the lair, and the hovercycle or motorcycle are in GM Notes. The grenades are stored as 1D4 hand grenades; the book allows smoke grenades in their place. The handcuffs row is the ordinary pair; the book gives them 3 M.D.C. The armor row is the generic light M.D.C. suit; the book gives 30 M.D.C."
